      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHERES WOOD WOOD (8) settled in the leading division before finding the lead and closing too well to win for second time in a row last start over 2190m at Shepparton, getting there by 1.3 metres. as the $3.00 favourite. No harm in drawing here with the sprint lane to rely upon. Finds a tougher race but another trip to the winners' circle is not out of the question. SPEEDY HEALEY (4) was successful at Geelong three runs ago but has been out of the money since, the latest effort seeing him making up some ground but only managing fifth over 2240m at Melton. Won't find this any harder and he can give this a mighty shake. LORIMERMAJOR (1) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish second at Shepparton over 2190m. Genuine threat. MONSIEUR FLAMEL (5) is in the mix after turning in a better effort last start to finish second at this track over 1690m. Solid each-way prospect.",
